https://si.imgix.net/5a55e825/uploads/origins/9b73ce3e-1728-4d83-8d25-741081c1df65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90019e66a1010f9392f7f8262c7ef9c4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n前回描いていただいたイラストがとても素敵で、今でも大切にしています。今回もぜひお願いいたします。\n\n最近いくつか新しいピアスを付けましたので、前回の雰囲気はそのままで、以下の特徴だけ追加していただけると嬉しいです：\n\nブリッジピアス（両側スパイク）\n\n眉ピアス：左右の眉に1つずつ。スパイクが上と前に向き、小さな角のような印象です\n\nリングを多めに着用（特に人差し指にリング2つ）\n\nピアスの位置や雰囲気については、参考画像も一緒に添付いたします。\nポーズや構図はすべてお任せいたします。\n今回も貴殿のセンスと表現を心より信頼しております。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします！\nhttps://imgur.com/a/piercing-references-wemgzH9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pe_1116/works/165", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/97637b6f/uploads/origins/d891f917-0c10-4796-a640-8ccec51fcc70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a478707ebd7077c09467ffcf1f303d10", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/97637b6f/uploads/origins/d891f917-0c10-4796-a640-8ccec51fcc70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a478707ebd7077c09467ffcf1f303d10, https://si.imgix.net/97637b6f/uploads/origins/d891f917-0c10-4796-a640-8ccec51fcc70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0ea861b7da2f04239e93ad103996586 2x, https://si.imgix.net/97637b6f/uploads/origins/d891f917-0c10-4796-a640-8ccec51fcc70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33fd785dfc3191b5be86b2bfb57f24d6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアートスタイルが本当に大好きで、私のocのアートを依頼できないかと思っていました！\n\n彼女はあなたの以前の134の作品のように、とても疲れた顔をしているはずです。吸血鬼のような歯と、少し血の気の多い鼻があれば最高です。\n\n殺伐としたミステリアスな雰囲気にしたいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/108LJSTazkh4Ikfe2PiFvQmI_qIiiBlPr?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pe_1116/works/164", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7e6bb7a/uploads/origins/a14bc9c7-8923-4c86-af27-fccdb76495d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a62a6833064f144da91a6f8ab2fb00", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7e6bb7a/uploads/origins/a14bc9c7-8923-4c86-af27-fccdb76495d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a62a6833064f144da91a6f8ab2fb00, https://si.imgix.net/c7e6bb7a/uploads/origins/a14bc9c7-8923-4c86-af27-fccdb76495d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=109be79dfc4df16eee499a3d0bf303bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7e6bb7a/uploads/origins/a14bc9c7-8923-4c86-af27-fccdb76495d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e5ad163bc1dde98e4e3e3d9dcc6f634 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "1 character. 17 year old male who looks feminine. So, otokonoko to put it in familiar terms. The context is that this character was castrated at a young age and didn't go through male puberty. Think of like gwyndolin from dark souls as a reference for how the body would look. Feminine face too, with long silver-grey hair parted at a 7:3 ratio. He has a big scar going across his eyes from a blade wound when he was a child. His eyes are still there but he is blind, so there should be a dullness to them. He wears a feather coat meant for travelling, and beneath it a robe like something a shepherd would wear with a rope that ties the waist.\n\nHe should be turned away from the camera but looking back over his shoulder at the camera. Background doesn't have to be anything complicated, but earthy tones are better than anything else. His face should be a slight frown but something fitting confusion and caution not sadness.\n\nThis is my OC called Julia btw. You are free to take creative liberty", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pe_1116/works/163", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2f454ff/uploads/origins/e52c0aef-bf29-4df8-9b67-af84ee41d686?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=331124788bef5c5d192e08c209ed1729", "thumbnail_srcset